WEBVTT

00:03.040 --> 00:06.650
You know, Catherine, despite 
this lovely weather we're having,

00:06.650 --> 00:11.240
with Lady Leticia gone, it's like all light
 has been drained from the castle.

00:11.240 --> 00:14.510
And here I thought she and Prince Clarke
made the perfect couple.

00:14.510 --> 00:16.950
Shh! You mustn't say such things.

00:16.950 --> 00:19.710
He has Lady Brianna now.

00:20.040 --> 00:25.960
I suppose so. She's the one enduring
those terrible princess lessons now.

00:25.960 --> 00:29.460
Lady Isabella! Lady Catherine!

00:34.080 --> 00:36.310
Sebastian, why all the commotion?

00:36.310 --> 00:37.600
What on earth is the matter?

00:38.980 --> 00:45.400
Her Majesty Queen Laura requests that you 
explain what took place at the evening ball!

00:45.400 --> 00:46.700
Oh my goodness!

00:46.700 --> 00:48.360
The queen herself?

00:48.360 --> 00:51.470
She would like to see you forthwith,
 so please go and—

00:53.870 --> 00:55.400
Was that Lady Brianna?

00:55.400 --> 00:58.730
I believe she's in the midst 
of princess lessons...

00:58.730 --> 01:01.960
I certainly hope nothing 
unpleasant has happened.

01:19.980 --> 01:21.220
No...

01:21.220 --> 01:26.750
No... more!

03:10.700 --> 03:12.970
Ah, what bliss!

03:12.970 --> 03:15.720
The weather is so nice today, Lily!

03:16.120 --> 03:18.400
Indeed it is, my lady.

03:18.400 --> 03:20.060
You know what, Lily?

03:20.060 --> 03:23.250
I'm lying on the lawn right now!

03:23.250 --> 03:25.510
Yes, you most certainly are.

03:26.360 --> 03:28.920
Rolly, rolly, rolly, roll!

03:28.920 --> 03:31.190
Gosh, this is the greatest!

03:32.350 --> 03:34.770
Now I'm free forever!

03:35.490 --> 03:37.070
Wanna try, Lily?

03:37.340 --> 03:38.420
Try what, my lady?

03:38.420 --> 03:39.560
Rolly rolling.

03:39.560 --> 03:40.930
No, I do not.

03:40.930 --> 03:42.580
But it's so fun!

03:43.620 --> 03:45.290
Okay, I'm going out.

03:45.290 --> 03:47.970
I'll stop by the village square 
on my way home.

03:47.970 --> 03:50.220
Anything you want me to pick up?

03:50.220 --> 03:53.090
No, we lack for nothing at the moment.

03:53.530 --> 03:55.840
Please take care and enjoy yourself.

03:55.840 --> 03:57.340
See you later!

04:11.060 --> 04:16.490
When I was still engaged to Prince Clarke, 
Lily was always kind of annoying.

04:16.490 --> 04:19.770
But since we moved here, she hasn't 
bothered me at all. You know why?

04:19.770 --> 04:25.120
It's because I don't have to behave 
like a lady anymore! It's the best!

04:35.000 --> 04:37.540
Now, which of you shall I use today?

04:43.350 --> 04:45.310
I choose you, darling.

05:30.920 --> 05:32.220
Looks like you're having fun.

05:32.220 --> 05:33.810
Wuh? Whoa!

05:50.830 --> 05:52.110
I got one!

05:52.580 --> 05:53.890
Good job!

05:53.890 --> 05:55.260
Thanks!

05:55.260 --> 05:55.790
Hmm?

05:56.720 --> 05:59.940
Bwuh?! Prince Clarke?!

05:59.940 --> 06:01.260
What are you doing here?!

06:19.740 --> 06:21.670
Here's to a fine meal!

06:24.690 --> 06:26.770
Ish sho goo'!

06:27.530 --> 06:29.160
Um, what is it?

06:29.550 --> 06:32.780
You returned that fish you 
just caught to the river.

06:32.780 --> 06:34.040
Well, yes.

06:34.040 --> 06:38.130
When the fish are too young 
or I catch too many, I release them.

06:38.880 --> 06:42.630
I don't mean to be greedy. 
I only want enough to enjoy.

06:45.100 --> 06:47.760
Would you like to try some, Your Highness?

06:47.760 --> 06:48.800
You don't mind?

06:48.800 --> 06:51.760
Go right ahead. 
The skewers are quite hot, however.

06:51.760 --> 06:52.780
That's hot!

06:52.780 --> 06:54.730
Did I not just say they were?

06:55.010 --> 06:56.990
The fish is also still hot, so...

06:57.600 --> 06:58.650
Ouwh!

06:58.980 --> 07:01.970
Do let it cool a little before you eat it.

07:01.970 --> 07:04.400
P'ease, I' ohay!

07:10.010 --> 07:11.030
This is good!

07:11.530 --> 07:14.370
I never knew freshly grilled fish 
was so delicious.

07:14.370 --> 07:17.250
Why are meals at the castle 
always served cold?

07:17.250 --> 07:21.040
Perhaps to avoid burning any royal tongues.

07:22.000 --> 07:24.820
Is that it? I suppose you may be right.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.420
This is so good!

07:29.770 --> 07:31.010
What does he want?

07:49.620 --> 07:52.410
Lady Lettie, that's quite a catch!

07:52.410 --> 07:53.870
Very impressive!

07:54.240 --> 07:59.130
I tried out a new fly I made 
and immediately got a bite!

07:59.130 --> 08:03.270
I'll be! Your flies bring 'em in
ten out of ten times, Lady Lettie.

08:03.270 --> 08:05.880
They're always sold out at the store!

08:06.180 --> 08:10.900
I brought a whole bunch today, 
so I'll drop them off at Sam's shop later.

08:10.900 --> 08:13.330
You make those flies yourself?

08:13.330 --> 08:14.010
Hmm?

08:14.010 --> 08:17.410
But they have hooks! You could 
end up cutting your hand on one!

08:18.560 --> 08:20.720
Um, who is that man?

08:20.720 --> 08:23.850
It's all right. 
He isn't dangerous or anything.

08:23.850 --> 08:25.210
Huh?

08:25.690 --> 08:30.700
Lady Lettie, we got some fresh vegetables in,
so please come take a look when you can.

08:31.030 --> 08:32.700
I'll make sure to stop by.

08:33.120 --> 08:35.610
Lady Lettie, you're prettier every day!

08:35.610 --> 08:39.040
I'll cherish the memory 
of your beauty into the afterlife.

08:39.040 --> 08:41.930
Oh, Granny, you're so much!

08:41.930 --> 08:44.750
Stay with us so we can visit again, you hear?

08:44.750 --> 08:48.010
Lady Lettie! I drew a picture today!

08:48.010 --> 08:52.220
My, aren't you talented! 
Maybe you'll become court painter one day.

08:52.220 --> 08:55.990
Lessons at school are hard, 
and they aren't any fun.

08:55.990 --> 08:57.640
We just want to play and stuff.

08:57.990 --> 09:01.310
Well, I wasn't very good at my studies either.

09:01.310 --> 09:03.610
But they should pay off in the future.

09:05.980 --> 09:08.030
John! How have you been?

09:08.030 --> 09:11.740
Care to try a new reel, Lady Lettie?

09:11.740 --> 09:16.700
Yes, I'd love to! Also, let me
 show you the new flies I made.

09:19.740 --> 09:22.200
That will <i>not</i> do!

09:23.690 --> 09:25.040
Hurry, run away!

09:25.040 --> 09:26.030
Stop right there!

09:26.030 --> 09:27.340
Here she comes!

09:29.780 --> 09:35.970
Since Lady Lettie's return, our village
 has been so lively and full of cheer.

09:35.970 --> 09:40.480
She may be a noblewoman, but she 
treats us all without a hint of prejudice.

09:40.730 --> 09:44.990
Everyone in town simply adores her.

09:50.180 --> 09:54.250
I see. I would be stealing her away 
from the people here.

09:55.300 --> 09:56.280
Hmm?

10:03.210 --> 10:04.480
Hmm?

10:07.890 --> 10:09.030
Don't worry.

10:11.730 --> 10:14.230
I'd do anything to make her happy.

10:15.730 --> 10:17.040
That's a promise.

10:26.180 --> 10:29.340
You're sure you're all right?
 It isn't too heavy?

10:29.340 --> 10:30.330
Want help?

10:30.330 --> 10:31.960
I appreciate it, but no.

10:31.960 --> 10:35.800
I'd never have anyone else carry
 my precious fishing gear.

10:35.800 --> 10:36.440
But...

10:36.440 --> 10:37.530
No, thank you.

10:39.100 --> 10:42.020
I was never cut out to be 
a princess in the first place.

10:42.020 --> 10:45.930
I've always loved running around, 
climbing trees, and fishing.

10:45.930 --> 10:48.940
I like the outdoors more than fashion,
and I have a real mouth on me.

10:48.940 --> 10:54.670
Nothing in the world makes me happier 
than being out in nature like this.

10:54.670 --> 10:58.930
So what the heck is going on here? 
What <i>is</i> that guy's problem?

10:58.930 --> 11:00.610
Oh, look! There's some sheep!

11:00.610 --> 11:01.560
Huh?

11:01.560 --> 11:04.660
They're so cute! Oh, there are horses too!

11:04.660 --> 11:07.890
Yes, I know. They're ours, after all.

11:08.320 --> 11:10.490
Do the horses graze out here too?

11:10.490 --> 11:11.500
Yes.

11:11.500 --> 11:17.360
The grass in the pasture is nutritious, 
so it helps them to grow big and strong.

11:17.360 --> 11:19.280
Wow, you're so knowledgeable.

11:19.280 --> 11:22.800
That's just what I've been told,
but my dream is to live in the countryside,

11:22.800 --> 11:24.450
so I'd like to study more about it.

11:25.120 --> 11:26.420
Leticia, do you...

11:27.610 --> 11:28.470
Oh?

11:35.490 --> 11:37.560
Sorry for all the noise.

11:38.530 --> 11:39.390
Oh!

11:40.020 --> 11:43.320
They get rather curious when
 strangers come around.

11:43.320 --> 11:45.850
I've never seen a horse this big before.

11:46.760 --> 11:48.350
It's so beautiful.

11:54.740 --> 11:56.190
Pleased to meet you.

11:58.530 --> 12:01.370
Whoa, you guys!

12:03.500 --> 12:05.160
Looks like they're hungry.

12:07.220 --> 12:10.740
I wasn't interested in him at all 
before, so I never paid attention,

12:10.740 --> 12:13.670
but talk about a prince! 
Just look at that handsome face!

12:14.140 --> 12:17.170
Royals really shine 
when they're out in nature!

12:17.440 --> 12:18.410
Is something wrong?

12:18.410 --> 12:19.070
Oh!

12:19.970 --> 12:23.580
Your Highness, what brought you
 out all this way?

12:23.580 --> 12:25.880
I wanted to take in the fresh air.

12:25.880 --> 12:27.920
Do not dodge the question, please.

12:27.920 --> 12:30.060
You must be busy with your royal duties.

12:30.360 --> 12:33.860
Coming to this village gave me 
a chance to see a different side of you.

12:33.860 --> 12:38.960
I got to see you angry, see you serious, 
and even see you smiling.

12:39.570 --> 12:41.320
I don't know what you're talking about.

12:42.340 --> 12:46.330
You actually haven't changed 
a bit since those days.

12:46.740 --> 12:48.330
What days?

12:55.250 --> 12:59.790
Oh, by the way, you and I are still engaged!

12:59.790 --> 13:00.680
Wuh?

13:00.680 --> 13:02.010
What did you just say?

13:02.010 --> 13:03.970
We're still engaged.

13:03.970 --> 13:06.520
I'll come to get you soon. Bye!

13:06.970 --> 13:07.970
Huh?

13:12.020 --> 13:14.660
What?!

13:28.570 --> 13:30.120
Lily!

13:31.060 --> 13:32.480
Lily!

13:32.480 --> 13:33.920
Welcome home.

13:33.920 --> 13:36.550
Whatever is the matter?
Why are you yelling?

13:36.550 --> 13:37.710
We should elope!

13:37.710 --> 13:40.180
But, my lady, I am a woman.

13:40.180 --> 13:42.460
Love can transcend gender!

13:42.460 --> 13:46.720
Unfortunately, there is no love 
between the two of us.

13:46.720 --> 13:48.010
That's so cold!

13:48.010 --> 13:50.370
More importantly, 
Lord Nadir is paying you a visit.

13:50.370 --> 13:51.430
My brother is?

13:55.560 --> 13:57.570
Brother Nadir!

13:57.570 --> 14:01.280
Quit stomping your feet 
when you run. It's rude.

14:01.280 --> 14:03.210
What in the world is going on?!

14:03.210 --> 14:04.070
What do you mean?

14:04.070 --> 14:06.070
My engagement hasn't been broken off!

14:06.070 --> 14:07.580
Yeah, I didn't think so.

14:07.580 --> 14:08.710
Why not?

14:10.300 --> 14:12.830
Prince Clarke's feelings haven't changed.

14:12.830 --> 14:15.830
Wuh? What about his other companion?

14:15.830 --> 14:18.620
Think back very carefully, Leticia.

14:18.620 --> 14:23.500
Did Prince Clarke ever actually say
a single thing about breaking it off?

14:24.450 --> 14:25.840
Huh?

14:26.320 --> 14:29.250
I cannot accompany you today.

14:29.250 --> 14:30.850
Do you mean to say...

14:30.850 --> 14:34.550
that this woman is your 
companion now, Prince Clarke?

14:35.240 --> 14:36.350
I'm sorry.

14:36.350 --> 14:39.850
Then does that mean that our engagement is...

14:42.240 --> 14:43.730
That's it exactly.

14:46.140 --> 14:49.660
This woman is your 
companion now, Prince Clarke?

14:50.260 --> 14:51.370
I'm sorry.

14:51.370 --> 14:54.860
Then does that mean 
that our engagement is...

14:57.170 --> 14:58.690
That's it exactly.

15:00.080 --> 15:03.380
Then does that mean 
that our engagement is...

15:05.690 --> 15:07.210
That's it exactly.

15:10.420 --> 15:11.940
That's it exactly.

15:12.530 --> 15:15.640
Did he say one word 
about breaking the engagement?

15:16.780 --> 15:18.530
No, he didn't.

15:19.950 --> 15:21.150
Lily?

15:23.620 --> 15:25.030
Brother?

15:26.720 --> 15:28.160
That's it exactly.

15:28.160 --> 15:32.640
You've gotta be kidding me!

15:33.290 --> 15:35.910
You were merely jumping to conclusions.

15:35.910 --> 15:39.170
Even though he was escorting another lady?

15:39.170 --> 15:42.260
Oh, that? He said he was 
trying to make you jealous.

15:42.260 --> 15:44.820
Wuh...?

15:44.820 --> 15:49.130
He seemed to take great pleasure 
in watching your enthusiastic reaction.

15:49.130 --> 15:50.960
And how would you know that, Brother?

15:50.960 --> 15:52.550
Hold it right there!

15:58.200 --> 16:01.190
I've had enough. 
Would you stop ignoring me?

16:01.920 --> 16:04.940
Oh, I remember you...

16:05.260 --> 16:06.440
The fish lady, right?

16:06.440 --> 16:07.450
Arowana, yes.

16:07.450 --> 16:08.450
It's Brianna.

16:08.740 --> 16:09.710
Ah!

16:11.290 --> 16:12.950
Anyway, don't ignore me.

16:12.950 --> 16:14.970
You brought her here too?

16:14.970 --> 16:18.200
Yes. She said that she wanted 
to speak with you.

16:18.200 --> 16:20.830
Listen, I'm begging you. Please come back.

16:21.260 --> 16:25.710
I've been stuck taking princess
 lessons ever since you left.

16:26.000 --> 16:29.360
Wuh? But <i>you're</i> Prince Clarke's
 companion now.

16:29.360 --> 16:33.610
I'm not interested in a guy who's 
head over heels for another woman.

16:33.610 --> 16:37.480
But the worst part of all is... is...

16:37.480 --> 16:38.980
Laila.

16:40.050 --> 16:41.760
I just can't with her!

16:41.760 --> 16:44.520
She's too crazy, too strict! It's killing me!

16:44.520 --> 16:45.900
I totally get that!

16:45.900 --> 16:48.950
Do you really? 
Then will you please hurry ba—

16:48.950 --> 16:52.690
But you've got to persevere and overcome 
in order to score the queen's throne!

16:52.690 --> 16:55.590
I'm telling you, that's not gonna happen.

16:55.590 --> 16:56.490
Why not?

16:56.490 --> 16:59.120
The prince made an official declaration.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.170
Saying what?

17:02.210 --> 17:04.930
That he will only produce heirs with you.

17:06.260 --> 17:07.100
Wuh?

17:09.490 --> 17:13.260
P-P-Produce heirs?!

17:20.060 --> 17:22.870
Lettie! Nadir!

17:23.610 --> 17:25.350
Mother?

17:25.350 --> 17:26.540
Why is she here?

17:26.540 --> 17:27.850
I don't have a clue.

17:29.610 --> 17:31.780
Why would I know anything about it?

17:32.110 --> 17:35.160
Lettie? Where are you, honey?

17:35.160 --> 17:37.140
Leticia?

17:37.140 --> 17:38.730
Jeez!

17:38.730 --> 17:43.040
Coming, Mother! Father!

17:40.290 --> 17:43.040
Please bring this luggage up later.

17:43.680 --> 17:44.880
Leticia!

17:44.880 --> 17:45.850
Lettie!

17:45.850 --> 17:48.440
What brings you both here?

17:48.440 --> 17:50.880
I've missed you so much, Mother.

17:51.880 --> 17:52.920
Ouch!

17:52.920 --> 17:54.870
I'm not here because you missed me.

17:54.870 --> 17:57.480
When we heard you moved back, we rushed over.

17:57.480 --> 17:58.570
Well, that's because...

17:58.570 --> 18:00.440
What in the world happened?

18:00.440 --> 18:04.320
Didn't you agree to stay until 
you finished princess lessons?

18:04.320 --> 18:09.690
Shelly, can't we talk about that later? 
Let's enjoy our reunion with our daughter.

18:09.690 --> 18:13.180
Darling, how can you be 
so carefree at a time like this?

18:13.180 --> 18:15.160
Our daughter's future is on the line.

18:15.160 --> 18:17.210
You don't need to exaggerate.

18:17.210 --> 18:20.040
What would've happened 
if Lily hadn't contacted us?

18:20.040 --> 18:22.530
I'd have been so worried! 
So worried that I... Ah!

18:22.530 --> 18:23.610
Mother!

18:23.610 --> 18:25.330
Are you all right, Shelly?

18:25.330 --> 18:27.170
What a happy family.

18:49.070 --> 18:50.440
I'm escaping.

19:06.210 --> 19:08.770
This white wine is delicious.

19:08.770 --> 19:10.920
Well, I prefer the red.

19:10.920 --> 19:12.800
Oh, you do?

19:13.820 --> 19:14.550
Hmm?

19:16.930 --> 19:18.370
Is something wrong?

19:18.370 --> 19:20.430
No, it's nothing.

19:20.430 --> 19:23.120
I guess I'll try the red next.

19:21.420 --> 19:23.900
Why are they still up?

19:23.120 --> 19:25.770
Oh, excellent.

19:25.770 --> 19:29.020
When I'm with you, 
everything I drink tastes wonderful.

19:29.020 --> 19:31.770
Oh, you!

19:40.770 --> 19:41.700
Okay!

19:44.060 --> 19:44.700
Wuh?

19:48.170 --> 19:50.230
Ow, ow, ow...

19:53.050 --> 19:54.670
I'm not letting you get away.

19:54.970 --> 19:56.110
Arowana!

19:56.110 --> 19:58.260
It's Brianna. Sorry about this,

19:58.260 --> 20:02.680
but if I don't bring you back,
I'll have to stick with the princess lessons.

20:02.680 --> 20:04.680
Please let me go.

20:04.680 --> 20:08.970
I've had more than enough of your tomfoolery.
I'll keep you here if it kills me.

20:08.970 --> 20:12.940
May I ask... are you perhaps 
looking for someone to marry?

20:12.940 --> 20:14.560
Wh-Why do you ask?

20:14.560 --> 20:17.580
And might you be interested 
in finding someone quite wealthy?

20:17.580 --> 20:18.950
What are you getting at?

20:18.950 --> 20:23.950
If you let me escape, I'll do what I can
to set you up with my brother, Nadir.

20:23.950 --> 20:25.580
What was that?

20:25.580 --> 20:28.630
Male heir to a duchy. Twenty-two. 
Smart as a whip. Totally athletic.

20:28.630 --> 20:30.000
Tall. Actually kind of a hunk.

20:30.000 --> 20:33.550
Personality issues, sure, but overlook that
and he's definitely a good catch.

20:33.550 --> 20:34.370
Well?

20:38.170 --> 20:39.440
I'm in.

20:39.440 --> 20:41.440
All right!

20:42.010 --> 20:43.340
I totally owe you one!

20:43.340 --> 20:46.360
My brother's favorite food is muffins. 
But not the sweet kind!

20:48.410 --> 20:49.910
I swear...

20:50.570 --> 20:51.570
Huh?

20:54.300 --> 20:56.470
Girls will be girls.

21:04.730 --> 21:11.290
I did it! Now I'm totally free!

21:15.020 --> 21:17.670
Wuh?

21:25.980 --> 21:26.590
Oof!

21:26.590 --> 21:27.730
Gotcha!

21:29.170 --> 21:30.330
Are you okay?

21:31.880 --> 21:33.450
Prince Clarke?

21:34.480 --> 21:36.070
Hey, Lettie.

21:36.450 --> 21:40.420
There's something I forgot to ask you.
It's about the color of your wedding dresses.

21:40.420 --> 21:43.070
We'll stick to white for the ceremony,
but what of the reception?

21:46.440 --> 21:49.650
I really don't think this is the right time.

23:20.000 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.130 --> 23:25.130
We'll proceed without delay on that plan we discussed

23:21.000 --> 23:26.010
Do you hate me for bringing you along like this?

23:22.000 --> 23:27.010
Let's get married

23:23.010 --> 23:28.010
...No way

23:24.010 --> 23:29.010
I'm glad

23:25.510 --> 23:30.510
Let me tell you right now how strong my feelings are for you

23:26.880 --> 23:31.890
Slowly and surely

23:28.390 --> 23:33.390
Sorry, but I just really want my freedom

23:29.890 --> 23:34.890
Are you awake, madam?

23:31.390 --> 23:36.440
You are a proper lady now

23:32.390 --> 23:37.400
Great

23:37.440 --> 23:40.020
I wish you happiness!
